{"id":"vor","lemma":"vor","pos":"prep","rank":70,"glosses":["in front of, ahead of (relative location in space)","before, prior to, ahead of (relative location in time)","ago (location in the past relative to the present)"],"ipa":"/foːr/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/De-vor.ogg/De-vor.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Vor wem haben Sie Angst?","en":"Who are you afraid of?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756037","words":[null,{"g":"who","l":"wer"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"fear"}]},{"text":"Was hatte er vor?","en":"What was he up to?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34556","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Was hattest du vor?","en":"What did you try to do?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760173","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe vor nichts Angst.","en":"I fear nothing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394233","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"fear"}]},{"text":"Das war vor vielen Jahren.","en":"That was many years ago.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566651","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"}]}]}